{"source": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/ioffice/22308/subview.do", "title": "Academic Support Program", "text": "New Student Adjustment Support Program Life Support Program Academic Support Program Career Support Program /WEB-INF/jsp/k2web/com/cop/site/layout.jsp ioffice_JW_MS_K2WT001_S Study Assistant program 외국인 유학생의 공부를 도와주는 한국인 Study Assistant가 국제협력부에서 상주 하며, 유학생이 방문하면 한국어 학습 및 전공 공부 학습 지원. 한국어 공부, 비자 서류 준비에 어려운 부분이 있다면 언제든 Study Assistant에게 도움 요청 가능 A Korean Study Assistant, dedicated to helping international students with their studies, is stationed at the Office of International affairs. International students can visit to receive support for Korean language learning and major-related academic studies. If they encounter difficulties with Korean language study, visa document preparation, or other challenges, they can request assistance from the Study Assistant at any time. 글로벌스터디그룹 프로그램 Global Study Group 한국인 학생 2명과 외국인 학생 2명을 팀으로 매칭하여, 학기 중 스터디 활동 진행. 함께 공부하며 상호 언어 교환 및 학과 학습 도움. 공부 습관을 길러 학업 성취도 향상 도모 Korean students are paired with international students in teams of two to engage in study activities throughout the semester. The program promotes mutual learning, language exchange, and academic support, helping students develop study habits and improve academic performance. Privacy Po"}
