{"source": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/bbs/ioffice/3549/362465/artclView.do", "title": "[대사관에서 비자를 받고 새로 입국한 경우] 외국인 등록 신청", "text": "K2Web Wizard Created 2025.07.07 Modified 2025.07.07 Writer 국제협력부 Views 108 [대사관에서 비자를 받고 새로 입국한 경우] 외국인 등록 신청 외국인 등록 (35,000 원 ) : 새로 외국인 등록증을 만드는 경우 [ 소요기간 : 4 주 ~8 주 ] ○ 신청서류 1. 신청서 2. 여권 ( 복사 ) 3. 표준규격사진 ( 흰색 배경 ) 4. 등록금납입증명서 5. 표준입학허가서 6. 재학증명서 ( 개강 후 ) 7. 체류지 입증 서류 복사본 ( 관공서 우편물 , 임대차 계약서 , 체류기간 만료 예고 통지서 , 공공요금 납부 영수증 , 기숙사 입주 확인서 ), 만약 본인이 직접 계약한 집에서 살지 않는 경우에는 ( 친구집 등 ) 반드시 거주 / 숙소제공 확인서 를 작성하고 , 거주 / 숙소제공확인서 와 제공자 신분증 사본을 함께 제출 8. 지문등록 ( 등록 신청 후 안내되는 날짜에 출입국사무소를 방문하여 지문 등록을 해야 외국인등록 절차가 완료됨 ) Attachments 거주숙소제공사실확인서(영문병기).hwp ★통합신청서(신고서)_전북대학교.hwp"}
{"source": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/bbs/ioffice/3549/362465/artclView.do", "title": "[대사관에서 비자를 받고 새로 입국한 경우] 외국인 등록 신청", "text": "않는 경우에는 ( 친구집 등 ) 반드시 거주 / 숙소제공 확인서 를 작성하고 , 거주 / 숙소제공확인서 와 제공자 신분증 사본을 함께 제출 8. 지문등록 ( 등록 신청 후 안내되는 날짜에 출입국사무소를 방문하여 지문 등록을 해야 외국인등록 절차가 완료됨 ) Attachments 거주숙소제공사실확인서(영문병기).hwp ★통합신청서(신고서)_전북대학교.hwp"}
{"source": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/bbs/ioffice/3549/362462/artclView.do", "title": "[For Enrolled Students] Visa Extension Application", "text": "K2Web Wizard Created 2025.07.07 Modified 2025.07.07 Writer 국제협력부 Views 177 [For Enrolled Students] Visa Extension Application [For enrolled Students] Visa Extension Application You must apply for a visa extension before the expiration date indicated on the back of your Alien Registration Card. Only students who have completed tuition payment are eligible to apply for a visa extension. If you applied for installment payment, you are not eligible for visa extension. Please take note. Visa Extension Fee: 60,000 KRW [Processing Time: 3 to 7 weeks] Required Documents: 1. Application form 2. Passport (copy) 3. Certificate of tuition payment 4. Certificate of enrollment 5. Academic transcript 6. Financial documents showing a balance of at least 8,000,000 KRW Not required if GPA is C or above If GPA is below C, you must submit a written statement explaining the reason 7. Proof of residence (copy of one of the following: official mail from a government office, rental contract, notification of stay expiration, utility bill receipt, or dormitory move-in confirmation) ※ If you are not living in a house under your own name (e.g., staying at a friend’s place), you must submit a Residence/Accommo"}
{"source": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/bbs/ioffice/3549/362462/artclView.do", "title": "[For Enrolled Students] Visa Extension Application", "text": "tay expiration, utility bill receipt, or dormitory move-in confirmation) ※ If you are not living in a house under your own name (e.g., staying at a friend’s place), you must submit a Residence/Accommodation Confirmation Form along with a copy of the provider’s ID. ※ When applying for an extension of stay, if all available spaces for stay period entries on the back of your Alien Registration Card have been used, you must apply for a reissuance of the card. In this case, in addition to the regular extension application fee of 60,000 KRW, you must pay an additional reissuance fee of 35,000 KRW and submit a recently taken photo. Important Notes: If you are enrolling in an additional semester beyond the regular academic period (e.g., a 5th year for undergraduate): → Submit Professor’s Recommendation, Statement of Reasons, and Financial Proof additionally. If you are advancing to a higher degree program (e.g., from bachelor’s to master’s, or master’s to doctoral program, under D-2 visa): → Submit proof of previous degree (e.g., graduation certificate) and financial proof, regardless of GPA. Attachments ★통합신청서(신고서)_전북대학교.hwp 거주숙소제공사실확인서(영문병기).hwp"}
