{"source": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/bbs/ioffice/3549/362457/artclView.do", "title": "Visa Extension for Students Who Have Completed Their Coursework", "text": "K2Web Wizard Created 2025.07.07 Modified 2025.07.07 Writer 국제협력부 Views 211 Visa Extension for Students Who Have Completed Their Coursework [Visa Extension for Students Who Have Completed Their Coursework] Application Fee : 60,000 KRW [Processing time: 3 to 5 weeks] Required Documents: 1. Application form 2. Copy of passport 3. Certificate of coursework completion 4. Academic transcript 5. Confirmation from thesis advisor regarding thesis guidance schedule 6. Original financial proof document (minimum KRW 7,000,000) 7. Copy of proof of residence ※ When applying for an extension of stay, if all available spaces for stay period entries on the back of your Alien Registration Card have been used, you must apply for a reissuance of the card. In this case, in addition to the regular extension application fee of 60,000 KRW, you must pay an additional reissuance fee of 35,000 KRW and submit a recently taken photo . Note: Students who have completed their coursework must pay close attention to the maximum allowable period of stay and ensure that they do not exceed it. [ Maximum Length of Stay ] Program Based on the admission date Based on the completion date Bachelor’s Degree Maximum 6 years"}
{"source": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/bbs/ioffice/3549/362457/artclView.do", "title": "Visa Extension for Students Who Have Completed Their Coursework", "text": "he maximum allowable period of stay and ensure that they do not exceed it. [ Maximum Length of Stay ] Program Based on the admission date Based on the completion date Bachelor’s Degree Maximum 6 years (7 years for 5-year programs) Maximum 2 years Master’s Degree (Integrated) Maximum 5 years (6 years for 3-year programs) Maximum 3 years Doctoral Degree (Integrated) Maximum 8 years (7 years for 2-year programs) Maximum 5 years Attachments ★통합신청서(신고서)_전북대학교.hwp ★논문지도·졸업시험·학점취득 일정에 대한 지도교수 확인서.hwp ★논문지도·졸업시험·학점취득 일정에 대한 지도교수 확인서(영문).hwp 거주숙소제공사실확인서(영문병기).hwp"}
