{"source": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/bbs/ioffice/3549/362451/artclView.do", "title": "Visa Change [When changing from another visa to a D-2 visa]", "text": "K2Web Wizard Created 2025.07.07 Modified 2025.07.07 Writer 국제협력부 Views 181 Visa Change [When changing from another visa to a D-2 visa] If you are admitted to a university and wish to change your visa to a D-2 visa, you must complete the visa change application before the semester begins, regardless of your current visa’s expiration date. Application Fee : 135,000 KRW For students who are changing from another visa (e.g., D-4, D-10) to a D-2 visa [Processing time: 4 to 8 weeks] Required Documents: 1. Application form 2. Passport 3. Standard-sized photo (white background) 4. Certificate of tuition payment 5. Standard admission letter 6. Proof of final academic background: Apostilled diploma, or certification from the embassy 7. Bank balance certificate (minimum 8,000,000 KRW) Must be from the applicant’s Korean bank account If receiving financial support from a professor, a financial sponsorship confirmation form must be submitted 8. Proof of residence (copy of one of the following): Official mail from a government office, rental contract, notification of stay expiration, utility bill receipt, or dormitory move-in confirmation ※ If you are not living in a house under your own name (e"}
{"source": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/bbs/ioffice/3549/362451/artclView.do", "title": "Visa Change [When changing from another visa to a D-2 visa]", "text": "icial mail from a government office, rental contract, notification of stay expiration, utility bill receipt, or dormitory move-in confirmation ※ If you are not living in a house under your own name (e.g., staying at a friend’s place), you must submit a Residence/Accommodation Confirmation Form along with a copy of the provider’s ID 9. For D-4 visa holders only: Certificate of Korean language program completion Academic transcript from the language course ※ If you failed to complete your last semester of the language program, a written statement of reason must be submitted Attachments ★통합신청서(신고서)_전북대학교.hwp 거주숙소제공사실확인서(영문병기).hwp ★사유서.hwp"}
