{"source": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/bbs/ioffice/3547/363761/artclView.do", "title": "[일본 도호쿠대학교] Application for TUJP Winter 2025‐26 Now Open! 東北大学日本語ショートプログラム受付中", "text": "K2Web Wizard Category Outgoing Created 2025.07.25 Modified 2025.07.25 Writer 국제협력부 Views 270 [일본 도호쿠대학교] Application for TUJP Winter 2025‐26 Now Open! 東北大学日本語ショートプログラム受付中 도호쿠 대학에서 홍보하는 일본어 및 문화체험 프로그램 입니다. 참여관심있는 학생들은 아래쪽에 나왔있는 도호쿠대학교 담당자에게 직접 연락하셔도 되고, 국제협력과 김원근 연구원 (outbound@jbnu.ac.kr / 063-270-4892)에게 연락주셔도 됩니다. 관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다. 이상입니다. ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Warm greetings from Tohoku University! We are pleased to announce that the application for “Tohoku University Japanese Program (TUJP) Winter 2025-26” is open now. We do not require the nomination. The students can apply directly. We do not set the application limit per university. We are happy to design a customized program based on your request. The programs contain the practical Japanese language, Japanese culture & society, and the exchange with the local students. We welcome both undergraduate and graduate students. 【TUJP Winter 1】 Date: Dec 5 - 18, 2025 ( 2 weeks) Credits: 3 ECTS equivalent Program Fee: JPY 105,000* Application Deadline: September 30, 11:59 p.m.(JST) Admission Notification Date: Mid October, 2025 Payment Dea"}
{"source": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/bbs/ioffice/3547/363761/artclView.do", "title": "[일본 도호쿠대학교] Application for TUJP Winter 2025‐26 Now Open! 東北大学日本語ショートプログラム受付中", "text": "1】 Date: Dec 5 - 18, 2025 ( 2 weeks) Credits: 3 ECTS equivalent Program Fee: JPY 105,000* Application Deadline: September 30, 11:59 p.m.(JST) Admission Notification Date: Mid October, 2025 Payment Deadline: Mid October, 2025 【 TUJP Winter 2 】 Date: January 21 - February 3, 2026 (2 weeks) Credits: 3 ECTS equivalent Program Fee: JPY 105,000* Application Deadline: October 20, 11:59 p.m.(JST) Admission Notification Date: Early November, 2025 Payment Deadline: Mid November, 2025 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- * The payment instructions will be given in the Admission Notification email. * The program fee must be paid via our online payment system. (accepted credit cards: VISA, Mastercard, JCB, and AMERICAN EXPRESS) *The program fee and processing charge (Credit card fee*) are nonrefundable. [Details] For the details like below, please visit our website! https://sites.google.com/tohoku.ac.jp/tujp/home Curriculum Eligibility Required documents Application form Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions. Kind regards, ------------------------------------------------------------ Kazuko SUEMATSU"}
